  "prefLabel": "Rko 201.04 Construction of Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rko 201.04 Construction of Rules. These rules shall be applied by the office so as to foster the just, accurate, and efficient resolution of complaints in such a manner as to advance the objectives set forth in:\n\n(a) New Hampshire Constitution, Part 1, Article 8;\n\n(b) RSA 91-A:1;\n\n(c) Laws 2022, Ch. 250:1; and\n\n(d) RSA 541-A:38.\n\nSource. #13921, eff 5-20-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rko100-200.html"
